# Runtime logs. poppys.log lands in the repo root when the app is run from here,
# and a log sent in for debugging is someone's usage data, not source.
*.log

# Companion state written when the app is run from the repo root (the default
# POPPY_DATA_DIR). This is one person's conversation history and streaks, not
# source, and it should never end up in a commit.
companion_*.json
companion.json

# Characters the user wrote. Real personal data, same as the profile and the loops
# beside it — it lands in the repo root only because POPPY_DATA_DIR defaults there.
characters_custom.json

# A 20 MB archive of poppys-app/, which is committed as source next to it.
poppys-app.zip

# The training set. Generated from our own prompts by models on this machine, so it is
# ours — and it is still adult dialogue that has no business in a public repo.
training/data/
training/adapters/
training/fused/
